<rml>
<head>
	<title>Login scene lines</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="base.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="login_scene.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="login_scene">
	<!-- What NewRenderLogInScene() draws over the login scene's world: in tour mode the MU logo,
	     its glow added to the world behind it, both fading in; the copyright line right-aligned on
	     the original's x 335 and "All Rights Reserved." left-aligned on it; the version line at the
	     left edge; all three on the bottom edge, white on a half-transparent black box sized to the
	     text. Positions and sizes are physical px computed in C++ from the transform the native
	     drawing used; the text is laid out at the font's cached size and scaled down to the native
	     size, as the native renderer draws it, so the lines keep its width at every size. Behind every other document of its context (the original drew these before
	     every window). Takes no pointer events. -->
	<div id="logo" data-if="logo_visible" data-style-left="logo_left + 'px'" data-style-top="logo_top + 'px'"
	     data-style-width="logo_width + 'px'" data-style-height="logo_height + 'px'">
		<div id="logo-glow" data-style-opacity="glow_level"></div>
		<img id="logo-image" src="../../../../Logo/MU-logo.tga" data-style-opacity="logo_level"
		     data-style-image-color="logo_color"/>
	</div>
	<div class="line line--copyright" data-style-top="line_top + 'px'" data-style-width="split_x + 'px'"
	     data-style-transform="'scale(' + font_scale + ')'">
		<span class="line-text" data-style-font-size="text_px + 'px'"
		      data-style-line-height="line_height_px + 'px'">{{copyright}}</span>
	</div>
	<div class="line" data-style-top="line_top + 'px'" data-style-left="split_x + 'px'"
	     data-style-transform="'scale(' + font_scale + ')'">
		<span class="line-text" data-style-font-size="text_px + 'px'"
		      data-style-line-height="line_height_px + 'px'">{{rights}}</span>
	</div>
	<div class="line" data-style-top="line_top + 'px'" data-style-transform="'scale(' + font_scale + ')'">
		<span class="line-text" data-style-font-size="text_px + 'px'"
		      data-style-line-height="line_height_px + 'px'">{{version}}</span>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
